message: "If you use this data, cite it and cite the source papers for any finding that matters to your work."
type: dataset
title: "eds-findings-tier2-recovery-v0 — Ehlers-Danlos syndromes (all 2017-classification types) and hypermobility spectrum disorder"
version: "v0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/PLACEHOLDER/eds-findings"
authors:
  - family-names: "Magennis"
    given-names: "Erin"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-9013-8052"
abstract: "896 machine-extracted findings from 229 papers on Ehlers-Danlos syndromes (all 2017-classification types) and hypermobility spectrum disorder. Tier-2 recovery: 323 pre-2019 EDS papers with no abstract in Europe PMC/PubMed whose abstract was recovered from OpenAlex; NOT screened (abstracts did not exist at screen time) — every row carries screen_verdict_uncertain=true. Well-formedness QA only; fidelity not human-adjudicated. Scientific fidelity is unmeasured."
